{"id":51724,"date":"2026-06-19T06:14:58","date_gmt":"2026-06-19T05:14:58","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=51724"},"modified":"2026-09-02T20:26:06","modified_gmt":"2026-09-02T19:26:06","slug":"ste-sintra-trail-xtreme","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/ste-sintra-trail-xtreme\/","title":{"rendered":"STE \u2013 Sintra Trail X\u2019Treme 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">STE \u2013 Sintra Trail X\u2019Treme 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>STE \u2013 Sintra Trail X\u2019Treme 2026<\/strong> (Caravela Seguros) realiza-se no domingo, <strong>20 de setembro de 2026<\/strong>, no m\u00edstico cen\u00e1rio da <strong>Serra de Sintra<\/strong> (S\u00e3o Pedro de Sintra), distrito de <strong>Lisboa<\/strong>. Coorganizado pela <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal de Sintra<\/strong>, pela <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Desportiva CTMRT &#8211; Clube Monsanto Running Team<\/strong> e pela <strong>Declive Sublime<\/strong>, o evento \u00e9 uma das mais conceituadas e t\u00e9cnicas celebra\u00e7\u00f5es de trail running do pa\u00eds, pontuando para o ranking internacional da <strong>ITRA<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com partida e chegada na hist\u00f3rica <strong>Pra\u00e7a D. Fernando II (S\u00e3o Pedro de Sintra)<\/strong>, a jornada inicia-se \u00e0s <strong>08:00<\/strong> com o emblem\u00e1tico <strong>Trail X&#8217;Treme de 33 km (+1.670m D+ \/ 2 ITRA)<\/strong>, seguido \u00e0s 08:30 do <strong>Trail X&#8217;Plore de 23 km (+1.160m D+ \/ 1 ITRA)<\/strong>, \u00e0s 09:00 do <strong>Trail X&#8217;Perience de 13 km (+530m D+)<\/strong>, \u00e0s 09:10 da caminhada com guia <strong>Walk X&#8217;Torical de 8 km<\/strong> e \u00e0s 12:00 do <strong>Kids Trail<\/strong>. Os trilhos passam por locais ic\u00f3nicos como a Lagoa Azul, Barragem do Rio da Mula e Convento dos Capuchos.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"