#FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o STE Sintra Trail X\u2019Treme 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento decorre no fim de semana de 19 e 20 de setembro de 2026, com partidas e chegadas na Pra\u00e7a D. Fernando II em S\u00e3o Pedro de Sintra.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e pontua\u00e7\u00f5es ITRA das provas?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O Trail X&#8217;Treme 33K atribui 2 pontos ITRA, o Trail X&#8217;Plore 23K atribui 1 ponto ITRA, havendo ainda o Trail X&#8217;Perience de 13K, a Caminhada de 8K e o Kids Trail.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os principais pontos de passagem do percurso?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Os atletas percorrem os trilhos fechados e propriedades da serra com passagem pela Lagoa Azul, Barragem do Rio da Mula, Capuchos e Castelo dos Mouros.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde funcionam os balne\u00e1rios e banhos?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Os banhos quentes funcionam nas instala\u00e7\u00f5es dos Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios de S\u00e3o Pedro de Sintra (Estrada Nacional 9, n\u00ba 22).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O Kids Trail \u00e9 gratuito?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o no Kids Trail \u00e9 gratuita para crian\u00e7as mun\u00edcipes de Sintra, filhos de atletas inscritos ou s\u00f3cios da ATRP, custando 4 \u20ac para os restantes.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"STE \u2013 Sintra Trail X\u2019Treme 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-09-20\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Pra\u00e7a D. Fernando II, S\u00e3o Pedro de Sintra\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Sintra\", \"addressRegion\": \"Lisboa\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"CM Sintra \/ AD CTMRT Clube Monsanto \/ Declive Sublime\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza o STE Sintra Trail X\u2019Treme 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento decorre no fim de semana de 19 e 20 de setembro de 2026, com partidas e chegadas na Pra\u00e7a D. Fernando II em S\u00e3o Pedro de Sintra.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e pontua\u00e7\u00f5es ITRA das provas?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O Trail X'Treme 33K atribui 2 pontos ITRA, o Trail X'Plore 23K atribui 1 ponto ITRA, havendo ainda o Trail X'Perience de 13K, a Caminhada de 8K e o Kids Trail.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os principais pontos de passagem do percurso?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Os atletas percorrem os trilhos fechados e propriedades da serra com passagem pela Lagoa Azul, Barragem do Rio da Mula, Capuchos e Castelo dos Mouros.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde funcionam os balne\u00e1rios e banhos?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Os banhos quentes funcionam nas instala\u00e7\u00f5es dos Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios de S\u00e3o Pedro de Sintra (Estrada Nacional 9, n\u00ba 22).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"O Kids Trail \u00e9 gratuito?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o no Kids Trail \u00e9 gratuita para crian\u00e7as mun\u00edcipes de Sintra, filhos de atletas inscritos ou s\u00f3cios da ATRP, custando 4 \u20ac para os restantes.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":51725,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,22,497,739,498],"event_type_2":[33,727],"event_type_3":[744],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-51724","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-sintra-lisboa","event_type-caminhada","event_type-trail","event_type-trail-curto","event_type-kids-trail","event_type-trail-longo","event_type_2-lisboa","event_type_2-lisboa-e-centro","event_type_3-sim"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/6a19ffe04b298_408824158_874812051314402_5890593166634011581_n-1024x1024.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/51724","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=51724"}],"version-history":[{"count":3,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/51724\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":65821,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/51724\/revisions\/65821"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/51725"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=51724"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=51724"},{"taxonomy":"event_type